  id: RiverBridgeStone
  displayName: Stone Bridge
  description: Cobbled arches between stout piers. Reaches 4 tiles out from the bank,
    and stands up to a lot. Drag out a straight line over the water; everyone can
    walk over it, raiders too, and they wear it down as they cross. Boats can't pass
    it.
